The separate projection tile is also already best for the large `dim=128` path. There is one oddity: for the small benchmark `N=256, bs=2, dim=128`, the interleaved full path is much faster even though the separate projection alone is competitive, so I’m profiling that case to avoid accidentally routing a slower path.
